1,"ps_ratio":1,"fcf_to_ev":16.95,"fcf_to_mcap":24.2,"liab_to_assets":59,"cash_to_assets":12,"current_ratio":1.69,"roe":12.8,"roa":4.8,"moat":{"ticker":"MEOH","period":"2026Q3","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"甲醇作為一種大宗商品，其價格主要由全球供需關係決定，而非單一企業的品牌或定價能力。Methanex 作為全球最大的甲醇生產商，雖然在市場上具有一定的影響力，但無法獨立於市場價格設定價格。其品牌價值主要體現在可靠的供應和質量，而非能支撐溢價的獨特消費者認知。與其他大宗商品類似，客戶選擇供應商時更看重價格和穩定性，而非品牌忠誠度。因此，在品牌定價權方面，Methanex 的護城河非常薄弱。","comment_en":"Methanol, as a commodity, is primarily priced by global supply and demand dynamics, not by the brand or pricing power of a single company. While Methanex, the world's largest methanol producer, holds some market influence, it cannot set prices independently of market forces. Its brand value lies more in reliable supply and quality rather than a unique consumer perception that supports premium pricing. Similar to other commodities, customers prioritize price and stability over brand loyalty when choosing suppliers. Consequently, Methanex's moat in brand pricing power is very weak."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"甲醇生產技術相對成熟，並非高度依賴專利保護。雖然生產過程可能涉及一些專有技術或流程優化，但這些通常難以構成持久的、難以逾越的壁壘。此外，雖然環保法規和安全標準對行業有影響，但這些標準通常適用於所有參與者，並不會給予特定公司顯著的監管優勢。Methanex 的競爭優勢更多來自於規模和運營效率，而非專利或特許經營權。因此，在專利和監管壁壘方面，其護城河得分很低。","comment_en":"Methanol production technology is relatively mature and does not rely heavily on patent protection. While production processes may involve some proprietary techniques or optimizations, these typically do not form lasting, insurmountable barriers. Furthermore, although environmental regulations and safety standards impact the industry, these standards generally apply to all participants and do not grant specific companies significant regulatory advantages. Methanex's competitive edge stems more from scale and operational efficiency than from patents or regulatory franchises. Therefore, its moat score for patents and regulatory barriers is very low."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"對於大型工業用戶而言，更換甲醇供應商並非沒有成本，但這些成本相對有限。轉換可能涉及重新談判合同、調整供應鏈物流以及對接收和處理設施進行少量適應性調整。然而，由於甲醇本身是一種標準化產品，且市場上有相對較多的供應商（儘管 Methanex 佔比較大），客戶在尋求更優價格或供應穩定性時，有一定程度的轉換意願和能力。因此，轉換成本並非一個強大的護城河。","comment_en":"For large industrial users, switching methanol suppliers is not without cost, but these costs are relatively limited. A switch might involve renegotiating contracts, adjusting supply chain logistics, and making minor adaptive changes to receiving and handling facilities. However, as methanol is a standardized product and there are a number of suppliers in the market (even with Methanex's significant share), customers have a degree of willingness and ability to switch when seeking better prices or supply stability. Therefore, switching costs do not represent a strong moat."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"甲醇行業幾乎不存在網絡效應。網絡效應通常出現在平台型業務、社交媒體或通信服務中，其中用戶數量的增加會提升產品或服務對現有和新用戶的價值。甲醇的生產和銷售是一個典型的 B2B 大宗商品交易，其價值不隨用戶數量的增加而增強。客戶購買甲醇是基於其作為化工原料的物理屬性，與其他用戶的使用情況無關。因此，網絡效應在此行業中幾乎為零。","comment_en":"Network effects are virtually non-existent in the methanol industry. Network effects typically appear in platform businesses, social media, or communication services, where an increase in user numbers enhances the value of the product or service for existing and new users. The production and sale of methanol is a typical B2B commodity transaction; its value does not increase with the number of users. Customers purchase methanol based on its physical properties as a chemical feedstock, unrelated to the usage patterns of other users. Therefore, network effects are practically zero in this industry."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Methanex 作為全球最大的甲醇生產商，擁有顯著的規模經濟優勢。其龐大的生產設施和全球化的供應鏈網絡，使其能夠以較低的單位生產成本獲取原材料、優化運輸物流並實現規模化的運營效率。這種規模優勢使得新進入者難以在成本上與之競爭，尤其是在全球市場上。此外，其龐大的採購量也可能在獲取天然氣（甲醇的主要原料）時獲得一定的價格優勢。這是其最主要的護城河之一。","comment_en":"As the world's largest methanol producer, Methanex possesses significant economies of scale. Its vast production facilities and global supply chain network enable it to procure raw materials, optimize transportation logistics, and achieve scaled operational efficiencies at a lower unit production cost. This scale advantage makes it difficult for new entrants to compete on cost, especially in the global market. Furthermore, its substantial purchasing volume may also provide a certain price advantage in acquiring natural gas, the primary feedstock for methanol. This is one of its most significant moats."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Methanex 在全球範圍內戰略性地佈局了生產基地和分銷網絡，特別是在靠近主要天然氣資源地區和關鍵消費市場的地理位置。這種全球化的佈局使其能夠有效地服務不同地區的客戶，並在供應鏈中獲得彈性。雖然其他公司也可能擁有生產設施，但 Methanex 獨特的、遍佈全球的資產組合，特別是其在特定地區的市場領導地位和物流基礎設施，構成了重要的競爭壁壘。這使其能夠更好地應對區域性供應中斷和市場波動。","comment_en":"Methanex has strategically located production facilities and distribution networks globally, particularly in areas close to major natural gas resources and key consumer markets. This global footprint allows it to serve customers in different regions effectively and provides flexibility in its supply chain. While other companies may also have production facilities, Methanex's unique, worldwide asset portfolio, especially its market leadership and logistical infrastructure in specific regions, constitutes a significant competitive barrier. This enables it to better respond to regional supply disruptions and market volatility."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Methanex 在運營效率方面表現出色，這得益於其豐富的行業經驗、先進的生產技術以及對成本控制的嚴格管理。公司持續優化其生產流程，提高能源效率，並有效管理其全球供應鏈，以確保穩定可靠的產品交付。其高 F-Score（7/9）和穩定的自由現金流（FCF TTM $1,242.1M）也印證了其卓越的運營能力。這種持續的效率提升和成本控制能力，是其在競爭激烈的甲醇市場中保持領先地位的關鍵。","comment_en":"Methanex demonstrates outstanding operational efficiency, stemming from its extensive industry experience, advanced production technologies, and stringent cost control management. The company continuously optimizes its production processes, enhances energy efficiency, and effectively manages its global supply chain to ensure stable and reliable product delivery. Its high F-Score (7/9) and consistent free cash flow (FCF TTM $1,242.1M) also attest to its excellent operational capabilities. This sustained improvement in efficiency and cost control is key to maintaining its leading position in the competitive methanol market."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Methanex 的資本配置策略似乎較為審慎和務實。公司在維持和擴大生產能力、優化運營效率以及適度回報股東之間取得平衡。儘管其現金部位相對較高，但負債水平也處於可控範圍內。自由現金流的產生能力強勁，為其提供了進行戰略投資和應對市場波動的財務靈活性。雖然其 ROE（12.8%）和 ROA（4.8%）顯示出穩健但非頂尖的回報率，但其資本配置的穩定性和對股東的回報考量，仍構成一定的護城河。","comment_en":"Methanex's capital allocation strategy appears prudent and pragmatic. The company balances maintaining and expanding production capacity, optimizing operational efficiency, and moderately returning value to shareholders. Although its cash position is relatively high, its debt level remains manageable. Its strong free cash flow generation provides financial flexibility for strategic investments and navigating market fluctuations. While its ROE (12.8%) and ROA (4.8%) indicate solid, though not top-tier, returns, the stability of its capital allocation and consideration for shareholder returns still constitute a certain moat."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"由於甲醇作為大宗商品，客戶選擇供應商時，價格和供應穩定性是首要考量。Methanex 作為最大的供應商，憑藉其規模和可靠性，能夠吸引並留住相當一部分客戶。其全球化的物流網絡和對質量標準的堅持，有助於建立客戶信任。然而，如果市場出現顯著的價格差異或供應中斷，客戶仍有可能轉向其他供應商。因此，客戶忠誠度相對較高，但並非牢不可破，護城河屬於中等水平。","comment_en":"As methanol is a commodity, price and supply stability are primary considerations for customers when choosing suppliers. Methanex, being the largest supplier, leverages its scale and reliability to attract and retain a significant portion of customers. Its global logistics network and adherence to quality standards help build customer trust. However, if significant price discrepancies or supply disruptions occur in the market, customers may still switch to other suppliers. Therefore, customer loyalty is relatively high but not unbreakable, placing the moat at a moderate level."},"m10_durability":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"甲醇作為基礎化工原料，其需求與全球經濟增長和下游產業（如建築、汽車、化工品生產）的發展密切相關，具有較長期的穩定性。儘管面臨來自替代能源或新材料的潛在競爭，但甲醇在短期和中期內仍將是重要的工業原料。Methanex 的規模優勢、運營效率和全球佈局，使其能夠在行業週期中保持相對穩定的表現。然而，長期來看，能源轉型和技術變革可能對其構成挑戰，因此其護城河的持久性屬於中等偏上。","comment_en":"Methanol, as a basic chemical feedstock, has demand closely tied to global economic growth and the development of downstream industries (such as construction, automotive, and chemical production), giving it relatively long-term stability. Despite potential competition from alternative energy sources or new materials, methanol will remain an important industrial raw material in the short to medium term. Methanex's scale advantage, operational efficiency, and global presence enable it to maintain relatively stable performance through industry cycles. However, in the long run, energy transition and technological changes could pose challenges, thus its moat durability is considered moderate to strong."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Methanex 作為全球最大的甲醇生產商，其核心競爭力體現在規模經濟和運營效率上，構成了顯著的成本優勢（M5）和穩定的全球佈局（M6）。其強大的運營能力（M7）保證了產品的可靠供應，並產生了充裕的自由現金流，支持了審慎的資本配置（M8）。然而，甲醇作為大宗商品，其定價權（M1）、專利壁壘（M2）和客戶轉換成本（M3）均較為薄弱。網絡效應（M4）幾乎不存在。客戶忠誠度（M9）和行業的長期需求穩定性（M10）提供了一定的緩衝。總體而言，Methanex 擁有一個以規模和效率為基礎的、相對穩固但非無懈可擊的護城河，類似於一個高效運轉的「收費橋」，在特定大宗商品領域具有領導地位。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"As the world's largest methanol producer, Methanex's core competitive strengths lie in its economies of scale and operational efficiency, forming significant cost advantages (M5) and a stable global footprint (M6). Its robust operational capabilities (M7) ensure reliable product supply and generate ample free cash flow, supporting prudent capital allocation (M8). However, as a commodity, methanol offers weak pricing power (M1), patent barriers (M2), and customer switching costs (M3). Network effects (M4) are virtually non-existent. Customer retention (M9) and the long-term demand stability of the industry (M10) provide some buffer. Overall, Methanex possesses a relatively solid but not impenetrable moat based on scale and efficiency, akin to a highly efficient 'toll bridge' in the specific commodity sector, holding a leadership position.","evidenceHash":"95d818fe31233718b11d4293a8abb54c7cbd421e91267e20210a47bf3ab57fd2","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null,"evidenceHash":"95d818fe31233718b11d4293a8abb54c7cbd421e91267e20210a47bf3ab57fd2","currentEvidenceHash":"95d818fe31233718b11d4293a8abb54c7cbd421e91267e20210a47bf3ab57fd2"},"fScore":{"score":7,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"grey","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-08T05:25:52.013Z","evidenceHash":"6936d72ac4db82cde1f5f87d37f6ffce4af986bf7efabd22d64d06e984dc0623"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-08T05:25:52.013Z","evidenceHash":"6936d72ac4db82cde1f5f87d37f6ffce4af986bf7efabd22d64d06e984dc0623"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/MEOH.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/MEOH.png","website":"https://www.methanex.com","ceo":"Richard W. Sumner","full_time_employees":"1649","description":"Methanex Corporation, established in 1968 and based in Vancouver, Canada, functions as a primary worldwide supplier of methanol. The company not only manufactures this essential chemical across North America, the Asia Pacific, Europe, and South America, but also acquires it from external producers through long-term contracts and spot market deals. To support its extensive global operations, Methanex possesses and leases storage and terminal facilities, and oversees a fleet of roughly 30 ocean-going ships. Its customer base primarily includes businesses within the chemical and petrochemical sectors.","description_en":"Methanex Corporation, established in 1968 and based in Vancouver, Canada, functions as a primary worldwide supplier of methanol. The company not only manufactures this essential chemical across North America, the Asia Pacific, Europe, and South America, but also acquires it from external producers through long-term contracts and spot market deals. To support its extensive global operations, Methanex possesses and leases storage and terminal facilities, and oversees a fleet of roughly 30 ocean-going ships. Its customer base primarily includes businesses within the chemical and petrochemical sectors.","description_zh":"Methanex Corporation（美股代碼：MEOH）為 Basic Materials 領域之重要企業，專注於 Chemicals 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"1800 Waterfront Centre","city":"Vancouver","state":"BC","zip":"V6C 3M1","country":"CA","phone":"16046612600","full_address":"1800 Waterfront Centre, Vancouver, BC V6C 3M1, CA","range_52w":"34.01-72.32","year_high":72.32,"year_low":34.01,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":34.01,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2017-03-23","name":"M&G INVESTMENT MANAGEMENT LTD","title":"10 percent owner","is_buy":null,"action":"","shares":0,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2017-03-23","name":"M&G INVESTMENT MANAGEMENT LTD","title":"10 percent owner","is_buy":null,"action":"","shares":0,"price":0,"total_val":0}],"stock_splits":[],"fmp_symbol":"MEOH","real_5y_prices":[],"historical_dcf_series":[],"name_en":"Methanex Corporation","expansion":{"status":"available","capturedAt":"2026-11-08T05:25:52.013Z","reason":null,"detailPath":"cache/us_companies/MEOH.json"},"z_score":1.81,"z_score_model":"z","z_score_zone":"grey","z_score_breakdown":[{"id":1,"key":"x1","category":"營運資金","desc":"營運資金 / 總資產 (X1)","desc_en":"Working capital / Total assets (X1)","weight":1.2,"value":0.10507086977214462,"contribution":0.12608504372657353,"passed":null,"detail":"0.1051 × 1.2 = 0.1261","detail_zh":"0.1051 × 1.2 = 0.1261","detail_en":"0